  "source_text": "poly = fill(2, 0)\npoly[0] = 6.283185307179586*(t1-floor(t1+0.5))\npoly[1] = 6.283185307179586*(t2-floor(t2+0.5))\npoly\npoly = fill(8, 0)\npoly[0] = tos[0]\npoly[1] = tos[1]\npoly[2] = 1000*exp(0.5*sin(10*tos[0]-7*tos[1]))\npoly[3] = 500*cos(12*tos[0]+15*tos[1])**3\npoly[4] = (1-floor((2-(sin(tos[0]-tos[1])))/2))*2000*sin(5*tos[0])*cos(3*tos[1])-(1-(1-floor((2-(sin(tos[0]-tos[1])))/2)))*2000*cos(4*tos[0])*sin(2*tos[1])\npoly[5] = 300*sin(sin(3*tos[0]+4*tos[1]))**2\npoly[6] = 100*exp(sin(tos[0])*cos(tos[1]))\npoly[7] = 1-2*(floor(3*(tos[0]+tos[1]))-2*floor(floor(3*(tos[0]+tos[1]))/2))\npoly\npoly = fill(25, 0)\npoly[0] = -5\npoly[1] = (exp(6.283185307179586i*3*t2)-exp(6.283185307179586i*t1))*200*sin(3*tos[0])*sin(tos[1])\npoly[2] = -5*(exp(6.283185307179586i*2*t1)-exp(6.283185307179586i*2*t2))*10*cos(5*tos[1])\npoly[4] = tos[7]*50*(exp(6.283185307179586i*3*t1)+exp(6.283185307179586i*t2))*sin(2*tos[0]-tos[1])\npoly[6] = -tos[6]*exp(6.283185307179586i*(2*t1+2*t2))\npoly[8] = (exp(6.283185307179586i*5*t1)-exp(6.283185307179586i*t2))*tos[5]\npoly[12] = (1-(1-floor((2-(cos(tos[0]+tos[1])-0.5))/2))-(1-floor((2-(-0.5-cos(tos[0]+tos[1])))/2)))*(exp(6.283185307179586i*(4*t1+7*t2))-exp(6.283185307179586i*5*t1))*tos[2]*tos[3]\npoly[15] = 500*(exp(6.283185307179586i*6*t1)-exp(6.283185307179586i*3*t2))*sin((tos[0]+tos[1])**2)*cos((tos[0]-tos[1])**2)\npoly[18] = (1-floor((2-(-0.5-cos(tos[0]+tos[1])))/2))*(exp(6.283185307179586i*10*t1)-exp(6.283185307179586i*10*t2))*tos[3]*tos[4]\npoly[20] = (1-floor((2-(cos(tos[0]+tos[1])-0.5))/2))*exp(6.283185307179586i*(7*t1+9*t2))*tos[2]*tos[4]\npoly[22] = -10*(exp(6.283185307179586i*9*t1)+exp(6.283185307179586i*9*t2))*sin(7*tos[0]-8*tos[1])**3\npoly[24] = (exp(6.283185307179586i*4*t1)-exp(6.283185307179586i*4*t2))*100*cos(sin(tos[0])*tos[1])*exp(cos(2*tos[0]-3*tos[1]))\ndrop\ndrop\npoly = rev(poly)\nemit\n"
